OL,3,GNEWSA'My wife would still be alive if
OL,4,ANHS Grampian had followed medical
OL,5,Aguidelines'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes as NHS Grampian faces mounting
OL,8,Fscrutiny over patient safety and levels
OL,9,Fof care. The health board has been
OL,10,Fasked to comment.
